-- title:
--   Exact jet graphs and mixed Taylor data for E8 production cell 0001
-- statement:
--   At dyadic precision $160$, these exact integer records give the eight interval jet graphs for the four center inputs and four whole-cell inputs of E8 production cell 0001. Each jet contains six intervals, for the value and first five raw derivatives. The mixed coefficient table records the ten center coefficients of total orders one through four and five remainder coefficients of total order five used by the centered Taylor replay. Separate equality, enclosure and positivity theorems certify these original numerical definitions.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/dpwoodru/general-courtade-kumar-lean/tree/04b6fc3f75b10c3c43702a883ddf888b0608a9a0/browse/GeneralCK

